  "translation": "I plan to travel to Beijing tomorrow. I first ask my friend about the weather. He says, 'It is very cold in Beijing now, what clothes have you brought?' I say, 'I will bring a thick coat.' I am seriously packing my luggage. I first put clothes into the suitcase. Then I put three books and several coats. I also bring a new map and a compass. I check for a long time and don't forget anything. In the morning I set out from home and go to the station to wait for a friend. My friend reminds me, 'Don't forget to bring the ticket!' I say, 'I won't.' My friend and I take the train together and chat on the train. We are all very happy."
